[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764626143","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104801#issuecomment-2764626143","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104801","id":2764626143,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kyNjf","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-30T16:01:46Z","updated_at":"2025-05-03T14:08:44Z","body":"I guess executing this code in a `@tool` script changes the layout in the editor itself. You should instead: 1. change the project setting `audio/buses/default_bus_layout` using the `ProjectSettings` singleton (optional); 2. edit and save the specified resource with `ResourceSaver`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764626143/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764643878","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104801#issuecomment-2764643878","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104801","id":2764643878,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kyR4m","user":{"login":"dragonforge-dev","id":172682465,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkrs4Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172682465?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev","html_url":"https://github.com/dragonforge-dev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-30T16:48:50Z","updated_at":"2025-03-30T16:48:50Z","body":"@dalexeev it is in a tool script. Here's the full code from the MRP:\n\n```\n@tool\nextends EditorPlugin\n\n\nfunc _enter_tree() -> void:\n\tvar audio_bus_layout: AudioBusLayout = load(\"res://addons/test_sound_plugin/resources/sound_component_bus_layout.tres\")\n\tAudioServer.set_bus_layout(audio_bus_layout)\n\n\nfunc _exit_tree() -> void:\n\tvar audio_bus_layout: AudioBusLayout = load(\"res://addons/test_sound_plugin/resources/default_audio_bus_layout.tres\")\n\tAudioServer.set_bus_layout(audio_bus_layout)\n```\nPerhaps I'm misunderstanding what you're saying and it shouldn't be in a tool script?\n\n1. I added in a line of code `ProjectSettings.set_setting(\"audio/buses/default_bus_layout\", audio_bus_layout)` in the MRP and when I ran the program it is all messed up. It now no longer shows up in the project loader. I cannot even re-import the project. It totally hosed my project. Regardless, that doesn't resolve this bug which is that the function AudioServer.set_bus_layout() does not appear to be working.\n3. I am again not sure what you are suggesting here. I created the resources by using the **Save As** functionality in the Audio tab. The load() function I am using is the ResourceLoader load function.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764643878/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764674652","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104801#issuecomment-2764674652","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104801","id":2764674652,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kyZZc","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-30T17:55:03Z","updated_at":"2025-03-30T17:55:03Z","body":"@dragonforge-dev If I understand correctly what you want to do, the code should look something like this:\n\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends EditorPlugin\n\n\nfunc _enter_tree() -> void:\n    ProjectSettings.set_setting(\n        \"audio/buses/default_bus_layout\",\n        \"res://addons/test_sound_plugin/resources/sound_component_bus_layout.tres\",\n    )\n    ProjectSettings.save()\n\n\nfunc _exit_tree() -> void:\n    ProjectSettings.set_setting(\n        \"audio/buses/default_bus_layout\",\n        \"res://addons/test_sound_plugin/resources/default_audio_bus_layout.tres\",\n    )\n    ProjectSettings.save()\n```\n\n[audiobus-loading-bug-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19526884/audiobus-loading-bug-mrp.zip)\n\nPerhaps instead of `_enter_tree()` and `_exit_tree()` you should use `_enable_plugin()` and `_disable_plugin()`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764674652/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2797240073","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104801#issuecomment-2797240073","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104801","id":2797240073,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mun8J","user":{"login":"dragonforge-dev","id":172682465,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkrs4Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172682465?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev","html_url":"https://github.com/dragonforge-dev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"ht