","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-11T15:34:26Z","updated_at":"2025-04-11T15:35:00Z","body":"That's something for dalexeev and other editor/script area people to decide. However this doesn't look like a bug to me but missing documentation for how to do this correctly, without more detailed information on what might be wrong, the suggestion provided doesn't look like a workaround to me but the correct way to do this","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2797252310/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2797299822","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104801#issuecomment-2797299822","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104801","id":2797299822,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mu2hu","user":{"login":"dragonforge-dev","id":172682465,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkrs4Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172682465?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev","html_url":"https://github.com/dragonforge-dev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-11T15:45:33Z","updated_at":"2025-04-11T15:45:33Z","body":"@AThousandShips Ok, thank you for that context.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2797299822/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2848647463","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104801#issuecomment-2848647463","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104801","id":2848647463,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pyukn","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-03T14:19:06Z","updated_at":"2025-05-03T14:19:06Z","body":"I think if it works as you described, then it can indeed be considered a bug, the editor should react to changes in Project Settings. I haven't tested it yet, but if it is confirmed, we should reopen this issue.\n\nWe could also add a note that in tool scripts this applies to the editor itself, as it may not be obvious. Although this is probably not the only case, so such a warning would be more appropriate in the tool mode and/or plugin documentation.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2848647463/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3693110903","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104801#issuecomment-3693110903","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104801","id":3693110903,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cIGZ3","user":{"login":"RechieKho","id":50512341,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNTEyMzQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50512341?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RechieKho","html_url":"https://github.com/RechieKho","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RechieKho/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RechieKho/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RechieKho/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RechieKho/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RechieKho/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RechieKho/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RechieKho/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RechieKho/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RechieKho/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-26T16:58:33Z","updated_at":"2025-12-26T16:58:33Z","body":"> [@dragonforge-dev](https://github.com/dragonforge-dev) If I understand correctly what you want to do, the code should look something like this:\n> \n> @tool\n> extends EditorPlugin\n> \n> \n> func _enter_tree() -> void:\n>     ProjectSettings.set_setting(\n>         \"audio/buses/default_bus_layout\",\n>         \"res://addons/test_sound_plugin/resources/sound_component_bus_layout.tres\",\n>     )\n>     ProjectSettings.save()\n> \n> \n> func _exit_tree() -> void:\n>     ProjectSettings.set_setting(\n>         \"audio/buses/default_bus_layout\",\n>         \"res://addons/test_sound_plugin/resources/default_audio_bus_layout.tres\",\n>     )\n>     ProjectSettings.save()\n> [audiobus-loading-bug-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19526884/audiobus-loading-bug-mrp.zip)\n> \n> Perhaps instead of `_enter_tree()` and `_exit_tree()` you should use `_enable_plugin()` and `_disable_plugin()`.\n\nThis indeed changes the default bus layout, but unfortunately it is still a \"default\". This means that the user would need to click the `Load Default` under the Audio Tab to actually make the change in bus layout reflect in the editor. Moreover, I do not found any alternative to `Load Default` via code. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3693110903/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]